    %% NexusProcure - Project Status State Machine
    [*] --> UNASSIGNED: Project Created (Auto Receive No)

    UNASSIGNED --> WAITING_ACCEPT: Head assigns staff to project
    UNASSIGNED --> REVIEW_TOR: Staff self-picks job (Step 0 TOR Review required)
    UNASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS: Staff claims job (Direct workflow)

    WAITING_ACCEPT --> REVIEW_TOR: Staff accepts assignment (TOR Review required)
    WAITING_ACCEPT --> IN_PROGRESS: Staff accepts assignment (Standard workflow)

    REVIEW_TOR --> IN_PROGRESS: TOR Review approved by Head of Unit

    IN_PROGRESS --> UNASSIGNED: Staff returns project to pool / Phase transition
    IN_PROGRESS --> WAITING_CLOSE: All installment rounds exported by Finance

    WAITING_CLOSE --> CLOSED: Finance staff completes final project closure
    CLOSED --> IN_PROGRESS: Installment edit requested (REQUEST_EDIT)

    UNASSIGNED --> WAITING_CANCEL: Staff/Head requests cancellation
    WAITING_ACCEPT --> WAITING_CANCEL: Cancellation requested while waiting
    REVIEW_TOR --> WAITING_CANCEL: Cancellation requested during TOR review
    IN_PROGRESS --> WAITING_CANCEL: Cancellation requested during progress
    WAITING_CLOSE --> WAITING_CANCEL: Cancellation requested before close

    WAITING_CANCEL --> CANCELLED: Head of Dept approves cancellation
    WAITING_CANCEL --> IN_PROGRESS: Head of Dept rejects cancellation

    CANCELLED --> [*]
    CLOSED --> [*]